@startuml Activity_Auth_Register
title Quy trinh Dang Ky Tai Khoan (POST /auth/register)

start

:Nhan request dang ky\\n(phone, password, fullName);

:Kiem tra so dien thoai da ton tai trong DB?;
if (Phone da duoc dang ky?) then (Co)
  :Tra ve loi 400\\n"So dien thoai da duoc dang ky!";
  stop
else (Chua ton tai)
endif

:Hash mat khau voi bcrypt (saltRounds = 10);

:Goi CountersService.getNextSequence('user')\\nLay so thu tu tu dong tu collection counters;

:Tao userCode = USR-00001 (5 chu so, can 0);

:Luu User moi vao MongoDB:\\n{ phone, fullName, passwordHash, userCode, role: CITIZEN };

:Tra ve ket qua:\\n{ message, userCode, phone };

stop
@enduml
